	quest.7FFE358FD81292D4.quest_desc: [
		"Refined Storage is a simpler digital storage mod with no channels to worry about. Place a controller, give it power and add disks."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r quartz enriched iron, processors, controller, disk drive and grid. Later: importers, exporters, autocrafting and wireless. Start with some iron ingots."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Iron Ingot and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
